<figure class="tl__fig">
  <svg class="sv" viewBox="0 0 660 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="mh-t mh-d">
    <title id="mh-t">전압은 병렬로, 전류는 직렬로 잰다</title>
    <desc id="mh-d">왼쪽은 저항 양쪽에 멀티미터를 나란히 대어 전압을 재는 모습. 오른쪽은 회로를 끊고 그 사이에 멀티미터를 끼워 전류를 재는 모습.</desc>
    <rect class="panel" x="5" y="5" width="320" height="290" rx="12"/>
    <rect class="panel" x="335" y="5" width="320" height="290" rx="12"/>
    <text class="b l grn" x="20" y="36">전압 = 병렬 (나란히)</text>
    <text class="b l" x="350" y="36" style="fill:var(--accent)">전류 = 직렬 (끊고 끼움)</text>

    <!-- 왼쪽 -->
    <path d="M60 130V180M60 194V260H280V130H215M155 130H60" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    <line x1="44" y1="180" x2="76" y2="180" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="4"/><line x1="52" y1="194" x2="68" y2="194" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="4"/>
    <rect x="155" y="118" width="60" height="24" rx="3" fill="var(--ground)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="3"/>
    <text class="s c" x="185" y="160">저항</text>
    <circle cx="185" cy="68" r="22" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--ok)" stroke-width="3"/>
    <text class="b c grn" x="185" y="76" style="font-size:22px">V</text>
    <path d="M169 82L155 130" stroke="#d63a2e" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
    <path d="M201 82L215 130" stroke="#2b2b2b" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
    <circle cx="155" cy="130" r="4" fill="#d63a2e"/><circle cx="215" cy="130" r="4" fill="#2b2b2b"/>
    <text class="s c" x="165" y="235">부품의 양쪽 끝에 대기만 함</text>
    <text class="s c" x="165" y="255">회로는 그대로 둠</text>

    <!-- 오른쪽 -->
    <path d="M390 130V180M390 194V260H610V130H565M485 130H390" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    <line x1="374" y1="180" x2="406" y2="180" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="4"/><line x1="382" y1="194" x2="398" y2="194" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="4"/>
    <rect x="485" y="118" width="40" height="24" rx="3" fill="var(--ground)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="3"/>
    <text class="s c" x="505" y="110">저항</text>
    <circle cx="545" cy="130" r="22" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="3"/>
    <text class="b c" x="545" y="138" style="font-size:22px; fill:var(--accent)">A</text>
    <path d="M525 130H523M567 130H565" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="3.5"/>
    <text class="s c" x="495" y="235">회로를 한 곳에서 끊고</text>
    <text class="s c" x="495" y="255">그 사이에 끼워 넣음</text>
    <text class="s c red b" x="495" y="278">전류 모드로 건전지에 바로 대면 합선</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>그림 3. 전압은 "양쪽에 대어 보는 것", 전류는 "길목에 끼워 세는 것"입니다.</figcaption>
</figure>
